        <mxCell id="n1" value="KEY DESIGN RULE&#10;Set-based logic (joins, population definition, duplicate detection) lives in dbt/DuckDB and is owned by vendor engineering.&#10;The rule engine only ever evaluates ONE enriched row at a time. Auditors change parameters and decision tables — never joins." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9E6;strokeColor=#B07A2A;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
